{"3616680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Edge", "steam_appid": 3616680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ocean stretches endlessly. A lone boat in the distance. You follow… but it never stops moving.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Edge</i> is a third-person mystery adventure set entirely on the open sea. You awaken aboard a strange vessel with no memory and no escape only the quiet hum of waves and a distant ship fading further into the horizon. As you pursue it, you’ll uncover clues and piece together a story that blurs the line between reality and something far more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you here? What lies beyond? And what truth awaits at the edge of the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚢 <strong>Single-Environment Mystery</strong> – Explore a detailed, immersive boat environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 <strong>Endless Pursuit</strong> – A second boat constantly drifts ahead. Always visible. Just out of reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Immersive Soundscape</strong> – A hauntingly atmospheric sound design amplifies the sense of isolation and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 <strong>Unravel the Past</strong> – Piece together a deeply personal mystery as you venture deeper into unknown waters.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ocean stretches endlessly. A lone boat in the distance. You follow… but it never stops moving.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Edge</i> is a third-person mystery adventure set entirely on the open sea. You awaken aboard a strange vessel with no memory and no escape only the quiet hum of waves and a distant ship fading further into the horizon. As you pursue it, you’ll uncover clue